  "text": "proprium.dominica-vi-post-pentecosten-alleluia",
  "about": "The alleluia of the formulary “6th Sunday after Pentecost” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": {
      "translation": "Alleluia, alleluia. In You, O Lord, I take refuge; let me never be put to shame. In Your justice rescue me and release me, incline Your ear to me, make haste to deliver me! Alleluia."
    }
